\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Exact Laguerre--Gaussian expansion, radial nodal washout, and discrete radial Gram conditioning. (a) Closed-form coefficients $c_{1,p}(R)$ [Eq.~\eqref  {eq:c_lp_exact}, solid] versus adaptive quadrature (circles) for $\mathrm  {LG}_{p,1}$ ($p = 0\text  {--}3$, $w/w_0 = 0.25$); inset shows $\log _{10}\lvert \Delta c \rvert  < -14$. (b) Nodal washout fidelity $\mathcal  {F}(p,1,w/w_0)$ [Eq.~\eqref  {eq:fidelity_fourier}] with Table~\ref {tab:fidelity} values (dots); inset compares exact $\mathcal  {F} = 0.95$ roots $w_{\mathrm  {crit}}/w_0$ ($p = 0\text  {--}8$) against $0.573/\sqrt  {2p+\lvert l \rvert +1}$ ($l = 1$). (c) Monotonic conditioning $\kappa (\gamma )$ of the unit-normalized Gram matrix $[\gamma ]_{nm} = \gamma _l(R_n,R_m) = \langle \psi _{l,R_n} | \psi _{l,R_m} \rangle $ constructed from normalized states $\{\psi _{l,R_n}\}$ versus diverging $\kappa (G)$ of $[G]_{nm} = \langle \Phi _{l,R_n} | \Phi _{l,R_m} \rangle $ constructed from unnormalized frame modes $\{\Phi _{l,R_n}\}$ (left axis), alongside adjacent power crosstalk $\lvert \gamma _{12} \rvert ^2$ in dB (right axis) for Table~\ref {tab:gram_matrix}.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lg_washout_gram}{{3}{8}{Exact Laguerre--Gaussian expansion, radial nodal washout, and discrete radial Gram conditioning. (a) Closed-form coefficients $c_{1,p}(R)$ [Eq.~\eqref {eq:c_lp_exact}, solid] versus adaptive quadrature (circles) for $\mathrm {LG}_{p,1}$ ($p = 0\text {--}3$, $w/w_0 = 0.25$); inset shows $\log _{10}\abs {\Delta c} < -14$. (b) Nodal washout fidelity $\mathcal {F}(p,1,w/w_0)$ [Eq.~\eqref {eq:fidelity_fourier}] with Table~\ref {tab:fidelity} values (dots); inset compares exact $\mathcal {F} = 0.95$ roots $w_{\mathrm {crit}}/w_0$ ($p = 0\text {--}8$) against $0.573/\sqrt {2p+\abs {l}+1}$ ($l = 1$). (c) Monotonic conditioning $\kappa (\gamma )$ of the unit-normalized Gram matrix $[\gamma ]_{nm} = \gamma _l(R_n,R_m) = \braket {\psi _{l,R_n}}{\psi _{l,R_m}}$ constructed from normalized states $\{\psi _{l,R_n}\}$ versus diverging $\kappa (G)$ of $[G]_{nm} = \braket {\Phi _{l,R_n}}{\Phi _{l,R_m}}$ constructed from unnormalized frame modes $\{\Phi _{l,R_n}\}$ (left axis), alongside adjacent power crosstalk $\abs {\gamma _{12}}^2$ in dB (right axis) for Table~\ref {tab:gram_matrix}}{figure.3}{}}
