\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {IV}{\ignorespaces Numerical verification of the closed-form $\mathrm  {LG}_{p,l}$ frame expansion $c_{l,p}(R)$ [Eq.~\eqref  {eq:c_lp_exact}] against arbitrary-precision radial quadrature of Eq.~\eqref  {eq:app_c_int} across $(p,l) \in \{(0,0),(1,0),(0,1),(2,1),(3,2)\}$, $w/w_0 \in \{0.25,0.50,1.00\}$, and $R/w_0 \in \{0.5,1.0,1.5,2.0\}$ ($w_0 = 1$, 60 total entries). Closed-form and quadrature values agree identically to all six displayed significant digits; the rightmost column reports the maximum IEEE-754 relative discrepancy $\max _R \lvert c_{\mathrm  {exact}} - c_{\mathrm  {quad}} \rvert /\lvert c_{\mathrm  {quad}} \rvert $ across the four radii in each row.}}{11}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
